    "notes": [
        "Goal: Manually prove ST08-011 grants <High-Maneuver> when you draw with an effect.",
        "Setup: Player A hand has GD01-001 (Unit), ST08-011 (Lane Aim pilot), GD01-100 (A Show of Resolve) [Main] Draw 2.",
        "Setup: Player A already has GD01-004 and GD01-008 in play (extra White Base Team units; not required for the trigger).",
        "Setup: Player B has ST01-008 (Demi Trainer) in slot1, which has <Blocker> via ATTACK_REDIRECT/redirect_attack.",
        "Step 1 (manual): Player A plays GD01-001 into slot1.",
        "Step 2 (manual): Player A plays ST08-011 as a pilot onto the slot1 unit (pair them).",
        "Step 3 (manual): Player A plays GD01-100 in MAIN to draw 2 (this is an effect draw; drawContext != turn_start).",
        "Expect: EFFECT_DRAW triggers and ST08-011 grants <High-Maneuver> to the paired unit (GD01-001) until end of turn.",
        "Proof (manual): Go to ATTACK with the GD01-001 unit and attack the opponent player/base; blocker step should be skipped because attacker has High-Maneuver."
    ],
